msgid "ReliefOS 5.3.4"
msgstr "ReliefOS 5.3.4"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid ""
"图形和 ncursesw 安装器统一为逐步向导，分别配置引导、分区、桌面和交换空间，并在写盘前显示安装摘要。IceWM 仍是默认桌面，可选离线安装实验性 XFCE "
"或纯控制台；改进文件复制和安装进度，并记录失败阶段与文件。"
msgstr ""
"The graphical and ncursesw installers now follow the same step-by-step workflow. Boot, "
"partitioning, desktop and swap options are configured separately, with a summary before disk "
"writes. IceWM remains the default; experimental XFCE and console-only installations are available"
" offline. File copying and progress reporting were improved, including the failing stage and file"
" in diagnostics."

msgid "新安装 ISO 把桌面、控制台和 ESP 的安装载荷集中到只读 SquashFS，启动时挂到原有安装路径；安装器运行根仍可写，安装后的默认磁盘根仍为 ext4。"
msgstr ""
"New installation ISOs bundle the desktop, console and ESP installation payloads in read-only "
"SquashFS, mounted at the existing installation path on boot. The installer runtime root remains "
"writable, and the default installed root remains ext4."

msgid ""
"重写安装器的离线更新：先只读预检再确认写入，分阶段监督 APK 事务和引导发布，保留已有桌面、外部软件包和受保护配置。在线更新改用原生 ``reliefos-"
"update``，支持审阅、续传、失败修复及内核启动载荷回退。"
msgstr ""
"Reworked offline installer updates to inspect the system read-only before confirmation, supervise"
" APK and boot publication in stages, and preserve the existing desktop, external packages and "
"protected configuration. Online updates use the native ``reliefos-update`` client with plan "
"review, resume, repair and kernel boot-payload rollback."

msgid ""
"Xorg 镜像接入 VirtIO-GPU/VirGL 和新的 VMware SVGA II 路径，修复 XDM 在没有用户会话脚本时的选择逻辑；启用试验性 XFCE 的独立 D-Bus "
"会话，并保留软件显示回退。"
msgstr ""
"Xorg images now integrate VirtIO-GPU/VirGL and the new VMware SVGA II path. XDM selects the "
"system session when the user's session script is absent. Experimental XFCE starts a separate "
"D-Bus session, and software display fallback remains available."

msgid ""
"增加 VirtIO 磁盘的安装、根设备识别及 initramfs 模块集成；修复模块冷插拔失败时 DHCP 不自启的问题。Taskmgr 使用稳定的进程描述符结束任务，Linux 程序可按需经 "
"``linuxuname`` 启动。"
msgstr ""
"Integrated VirtIO disks into installation, root-device detection and initramfs modules. DHCP can "
"now start after a module coldplug failure. Taskmgr uses stable process descriptors when ending "
"tasks, and Linux programs can opt in to launching through ``linuxuname``."

msgid ""
"libbsd、dosfstools、e2fsprogs、util-linux 和 libmd 改用 Alpine 的签名 APK，运行配置统一提供实际的 CA 证书包；CI "
"分组并行运行，复用构建缓存。"
msgstr ""
"libbsd, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, util-linux and libmd now come from signed Alpine APKs; all runtime"
" profiles ship the CA certificate bundle. CI runs regression groups in parallel and reuses build "
"caches."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

msgid ""
"**是，涉及旧应用和自制安装介质。** 移除旧 windowd 程序和 browser 使用的 litehtml 子模块；调用旧程序入口的脚本或快捷方式应迁移到仍受支持的 X11 "
"应用。自制安装介质的脚本必须适配独立 SquashFS 载荷；现有磁盘无需转换格式。"
msgstr ""
"**Yes: legacy applications and custom installation media are affected.** Legacy windowd "
"applications and the litehtml submodule used by browser were removed. Migrate scripts and "
"shortcuts that call the old executables to supported X11 applications. Custom installation media "
"scripts must account for the separate SquashFS payload. Existing disks do not require format "
"conversion."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Upgrade and migration notes"

msgid "本次为 **源码发布**，不附 ISO、VMDK、SDK 或 APK 二进制。源码构建前请递归同步子模块；计划更新前先备份用户文件和引导分区，检查磁盘空间与信任密钥。"
msgstr ""
"This is a **source release**, with no ISO, VMDK, SDK or APK binaries attached. Sync submodules "
"recursively before building from source. Before applying an update, back up user files and the "
"boot partition, and check free space and trusted keys."

msgid "离线更新不重新分区或更换桌面；在线更新的回退只覆盖内核、initramfs 和匹配模块，不撤销已提交的普通软件包。旧版若缺少本版需要的引导资源，应使用匹配的安装介质完成迁移。"
msgstr ""
"Offline updates do not repartition the disk or replace the desktop. Online-update rollback covers"
" the kernel, initramfs and matching modules only, not ordinary packages already committed. If an "
"older installation lacks the required boot resources, migrate it using matching installation "
"media."

msgid "XFCE 仍为实验性。QEMU 默认仍使用 AHCI；切换 VirtIO 磁盘需显式选择，且安装器不会在 4Kn 磁盘上执行新建分区或格式化。"
msgstr ""
"XFCE remains experimental. QEMU still defaults to AHCI; VirtIO disks require explicit opt-in, and"
" the installer does not create partitions or format disks with 4Kn logical sectors."

msgid "本次版本检查覆盖版本头、``VERSION_ID``、两仓的中英日文档和文档站点。未重新构建整版镜像或执行完整 QEMU 回归；**VMware 验证未完成**，未重新验证实体硬件。"
msgstr ""
"Release checks covered the generated version header, ``VERSION_ID``, both manuals in Chinese, "
"English and Japanese, and the documentation site. Full-release images and QEMU regressions were "
"not rerun. **VMware verification is incomplete**; physical hardware was not retested."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer notes"

msgid ""
"``configs/build-version`` 和 ``/etc/os-release`` 的 ``VERSION_ID`` 均为 **5.3.4**，生成数字字段为 "
"**5/3/4**。内核提交固定为 ReliefNT v5.3.4；不要混用其他版本的模块或 initramfs。"
msgstr ""
"Both ``configs/build-version`` and ``VERSION_ID`` in ``/etc/os-release`` are **5.3.4**, with "
"generated numeric fields **5/3/4**. The kernel is pinned to ReliefNT v5.3.4; do not mix modules "
"or initramfs images from other versions."

msgid ""
"发布范围为上一版本提交 ``e6079844756d023d16ca78715b8b3a9d299ac091`` 之后至本次版本提交，仅汇总 ReliefOS 主仓的有效更改；内核实现另见 "
"ReliefNT 发布说明。"
msgstr ""
"The release covers changes after the previous version commit "
"``e6079844756d023d16ca78715b8b3a9d299ac091`` through this version commit. It summarizes effective"
" ReliefOS changes only; see the separate ReliefNT release notes for kernel implementation "
"changes."
